<odoo>

<!--
  Jimny 4x4 Rentals building blocks.

  Backgrounds/text are hardcoded per block in style.scss (dark ink
  #14170F, forest #1F4A0B, cream #F5E7CC, or parchment #EDE6D3),
  matching the originally approved design's alternating dark/light
  rhythm. This used to be done via Odoo's o_cc/o_ccN theme-color
  classes instead, but that broke silently: editing the site's theme
  colors through the picker UI changed a section's background without
  correctly updating its paired heading/text color, leaving text
  unreadable. Hardcoding trades away per-block retinting via the
  block's own Colors option for guaranteed readability.
  Layout uses Bootstrap 5's grid (container/row/col-lg-*); buttons are
  plain .btn/.btn-primary/.btn-outline-primary/.btn-secondary, styled
  explicitly per section below rather than inheriting a color combo.
-->

